    "doi": "10.1016/j.tig.2026.09.002",
    "title": "Richer together: genetics and spirituality in public conversation."
  },
  "content": {
    "abstract": "Using a conference on genetics and spirituality as a case study, this article examines strategies for engaging diverse audiences in conversations about Clustered Regularly Interspaced Short Palindromic Repeats (CRISPR) and related genetic technologies. Six lessons are identified for fostering constructive dialog, mutual learning, and public engagement across scientific and spiritual communities.",
